{"overview":"شرک از زندگی یکنواخت خود خسته شده برای همین آرزو دارد تا به روزهای قبل که مردم از او می‌ترسیدند و به تنهایی زندگی می‌کرد بازگردد...","tagline":"","overview_en":"A midlife-crisis burdened Shrek, longing for the days of when he felt like a real ogre, makes a pact with magic deal-maker Rumpelstiltskin. But when he's duped and sent to a twisted version of Far Far Away—where Rumpelstiltskin is king, ogres are hunted, and he and Fiona have never met—he sets out to restore his world and reclaim his true love.","tagline_en":"It ain't ogre... til it's ogre.","runtime":93,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["Mike Mitchell"],"crew_en":[],"countries":["US"],"cast":[{"name":"مایک مایرز","role":"Shrek (voice)","photo":"/gjfDl52Kk02MPgUYFjs9bOy33OY.jpg","en":"Mike Myers"},{"name":"ادی مورفی","role":"Donkey (voice)","photo":"/qgjMfefsKwSYsyCaIX46uyOXIpy.jpg","en":"Eddie Murphy"},{"name":"کامرون دیاز","role":"Princess Fiona (voice)","photo":"/tIWUyvmJayu8gtbrzCWC0L3H8kH.jpg","en":"Cameron Diaz"},{"name":"آنتونیو باندراس","role":"Puss in Boots (voice)","photo":"/n8YlGookYzgD3cmpMP45BYRNIoh.jpg","en":"Antonio Banderas"},{"name":"والت دورن","role":"Rumpelstiltskin / Priest / Krekraw Ogre (voice)","photo":"/tGWQRNz8T5VNPZgNU2LafpNt2Jn.jpg","en":"Walt Dohrn"},{"name":"Julie Andrews","role":"Queen Lillian (voice)","photo":"/ltU0aAunzQCTv5FwtB1sVWjyDi7.jpg"},{"name":"جان کلیز","role":"King Harold (voice)","photo":"/nQpBf77cStmR35V0XOinm2zZMWG.jpg","en":"John Cleese"},{"name":"جان هام","role":"Brogan (voice)","photo":"/mrXE5fZbEDPc7BEE5G21J6qrwzi.jpg","en":"Jon Hamm"},{"name":"جین لینچ","role":"Gretched (voice)","photo":"/nye6D17ZfCHQzr9faYZYyz1CPsZ.jpg","en":"Jane Lynch"},{"name":"کریگ رابینسون","role":"Cookie (voice)","photo":"/mTyTrOWUSOBJMOlDpnd4OYx7FlJ.jpg","en":"Craig Robinson"},{"name":"لیک بل","role":"Patrol Witch / Wagon Witch #2 (voice)","photo":"/sITVdq39jtR1l3VohWYDyxorx1v.jpg","en":"Lake Bell"},{"name":"Larry King","role":"Doris (voice)","photo